  ex:sourceQuestion "Where was the type specimen of a given species originally collected?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which type specimens originate from a specified geographic region or island group?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which type specimens are published or mentioned in the journal, and what associated metadata are available (e.g., hosting institution, institutional codes, specimen identifiers/PIDs, taxonomic information, locality, sex, and number of specimens)?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "How many type specimens are represented in the journal?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which institutions and collections currently hold the type specimens published in the journal?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "How are the type specimens published in the journal distributed geographically according to collection localities or gathering sites?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which publications in the journal contain type specimen information, and which publications can be identified as type specimen catalogues?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "In which publications and publication sections is information on a specific type specimen reported?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which publications contribute the largest number of type specimen records to the journal?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "How has the publication of type specimen information changed over time within the journal?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which type specimens are documented in the available type specimen catalogues and publications, and what information is available for them?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which authors or specialists have documented type specimens from my collection?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which publications provide information about a particular type specimen or group of type specimens?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which metadata elements (e.g., taxonomy, locality, collector, identifiers, repository information, references, images) are documented for type specimens in the available catalogues and publications?" ;
