  ex:sourceQuestion "Which type specimens have associated identifiers, collection numbers, or links to external resources?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which type specimens are associated with the richest network of linked information, such as publications, taxonomic names, institutions, collectors, localities, and identifiers?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which type specimens are documented in the collection?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "How are type specimens distributed across taxonomic groups?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "Which taxonomic groups are best represented in the collection?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "What geographic regions are represented by the collection's type specimens?" ;
  ex:sourceQuestion "What are the principal scientific strengths of the collection?" ;
